# Normalize line endings to LF on commit, regardless of OS.
# Prevents SHA-256 hash mismatches between Windows (CRLF) and Linux (LF) clones,
# which caused a full re-hash of 17K+ files during incremental indexing.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary files — no conversion
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.whl binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary
# DB backups go to GitHub Releases, not LFS — see CLAUDE.md "Backup & Disaster Recovery"
